            <ArticleTitle>Chronic low back pain and depression in a sample of veterans.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>348</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The relationship between chronic low back pain and scores on depression was examined in a sample of 31 veterans who completed a depression inventory. Analysis indicated that those with chronic low back pain scored significantly higher on depression than those without.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
